systemd-pilot (4.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rewrite for GTK 4 and libadwaita, built with meson.
  * Verify SSH host keys and pass sudo passwords on standard input.
  * Report systemctl failures instead of showing them as success.
  * Support user services for every action, locally and remotely.

